<title>USA: Enstar begins offer for up to 600,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Enstar begins offer for up to 600,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enstar Inc said Wednesday it had launched a previously announced self-tender offer to buy up to 600,000 shares of its stock.</p>
<p>The modified &quot;dutch auction&quot; offer will be at a price to to be determined by the company between $4.75 to $6.25 a share in cash, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
